{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an image-only model using ResNet50 without RNA data, achieving validation accuracy of 0.2079 and F1 of 0.1718. These results suggest image-only models underperform compared to RNA-only (0.4849) and multimodal baselines (0.5266), but the exact impact of modality or encoder choices remains uncertain without direct comparisons to alternative single-modality configurations."
}

